        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Trace of Gladius” is a VR sword action game that uses a VR device to fight monsters with a sword.<br>The player fights by using skills called <strong>Traces</strong>, which are activated depending on how the sword is swung.<br>The player challenges a total of four stages where fantasy-style monsters appear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System [Trace]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Trace of Gladius</i>, the means of attacking monsters is limited only to the skill called Trace.<br>Attacks that do not use a Trace cannot deal damage to monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Trace has the following characteristics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Trace is composed of one or multiple sword strokes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sword strokes exist in eight directions: vertical, horizontal, and diagonal.<br>Combined with which hand is holding the sword, there are a total of sixteen sword strokes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, a Trace called <strong>BladeFlow</strong> consists of three sword strokes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right hand: slash from upper right to lower left</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left hand: slash from left to right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right hand: slash from left to right</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Below is how <strong>BladeFlow</strong> is actually activated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136440/extras/45da5332e1bbc82a7e59f61f30f11abc.poster.avif?t=1766948743\" aria-label=\"Example of BladeFlow in action\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136440/extras/45da5332e1bbc82a7e59f61f30f11abc.webm?t=1766948743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136440/extras/45da5332e1bbc82a7e59f61f30f11abc.mp4?t=1766948743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player, VR-only offline game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four-layered stages (1 tutorial stage and 3 stages where multiple monsters appear)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 types of Traces always available for selection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 types of monsters appear</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Streaming Guidelines</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may stream or upload videos without obtaining prior permission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is permitted only when using the monetization features provided by the video streaming platform.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please include a link to this store page in the video description.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note that these guidelines are subject to additions or changes without prior notice.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Trace of Gladius” is a VR sword action game that uses a VR device to fight monsters with a sword.<br>The player fights by using skills called <strong>Traces</strong>, which are activated depending on how the sword is swung.<br>The player challenges a total of four stages where fantasy-style monsters appear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System [Trace]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Trace of Gladius</i>, the means of attacking monsters is limited only to the skill called Trace.<br>Attacks that do not use a Trace cannot deal damage to monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Trace has the following characteristics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One Trace is composed of one or multiple sword strokes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sword strokes exist in eight directions: vertical, horizontal, and diagonal.<br>Combined with which hand is holding the sword, there are a total of sixteen sword strokes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, a Trace called <strong>BladeFlow</strong> consists of three sword strokes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right hand: slash from upper right to lower left</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left hand: slash from left to right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right hand: slash from left to right</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Below is how <strong>BladeFlow</strong> is actually activated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136440/extras/45da5332e1bbc82a7e59f61f30f11abc.poster.avif?t=1766948743\" aria-label=\"Example of BladeFlow in action\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136440/extras/45da5332e1bbc82a7e59f61f30f11abc.webm?t